<span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fear_of_failure.\" title=\"Fear of failure.\">Fear of failure.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pork_is_a_sausage.\" title=\"Pork is a sausage.\">Pork is a sausage.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">A pistachio eclair.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Welcome_to_Rico_Face.\" title=\"Welcome to Rico Face.\">Welcome to Rico Face.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/There%27s_strength_in_arches.\" title=\"There&#39;s strength in arches.\">There's strength in arches.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">A pistachio eclair.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/20/A_pistachio_eclair..png/revision/latest?cb=20210116014742\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"A pistachio eclair.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/20/A_pistachio_eclair..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210116014742\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/20/A_pistachio_eclair..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210116014742 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/20/A_pistachio_eclair..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210116014742 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"A pistachio eclair.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"A_pistachio_eclair..png\" data-image-name=\"A pistachio eclair..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_2\" title=\"Series 2\">2</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Katherine_Ryan\" title=\"Katherine Ryan\">Katherine Ryan</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pork_is_a_sausage.\" title=\"Pork is a sausage.\">Pork is a sausage.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Welcome_to_Rico_Face.\" title=\"Welcome to Rico Face.\">Welcome to Rico Face.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>A pistachio eclair.</b></i> is the third episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_2\" title=\"Series 2\">Series 2</a> of <i>Taskmaster</i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 5 July 2016. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Katherine_Ryan\" title=\"Katherine Ryan\">Katherine Ryan</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_pistachio_eclair.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Both the title and title card reference <a href=\"/wiki/Jon_Richardson\" title=\"Jon Richardson\">Jon Richardson</a>'s attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Impress_this_mayor\" title=\"Impress this mayor\">Impress this mayor</a> task. \"A pistachio éclair\" was what Jon revealed to be the subject of a photo that he was trying to impress the Mayor of Chesham.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_pistachio_eclair.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'En pistacieeclair', which translates as 'A pistachio éclair'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Pistaasi-tuulihattu', which translates as 'A pistachio éclair'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'En pistasjéclair', which translates as 'A pistachio éclair'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_pistachio_eclair.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Doc_Brown\" title=\"Doc Brown\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Doc Brown</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Wilkinson\" title=\"Joe Wilkinson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joe Wilkinson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jon_Richardson\" title=\"Jon Richardson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jon Richardson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Katherine_Ryan\" title=\"Katherine Ryan\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Katherine Ryan</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Osman\" title=\"Richard Osman\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Richard Osman</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_dinner_party_guest\" title=\"Best dinner party guest\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best dinner party guest.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Impress_this_Mayor\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Impress this Mayor\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Impress this mayor.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_most_unexpected_silhouette_on_this_screen\" title=\"Make the most unexpected silhouette on this screen\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the most unexpected silhouette on this screen.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Buy_a_gift_for_the_Taskmaster\" title=\"Buy a gift for the Taskmaster\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Buy a gift for the Taskmaster.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/Get_a_potato\" title=\"Get a potato\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Put on this blindfold, then instruct only the person closest to you to open their task.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Team:</b> Put the earplugs in your ears and the ear protectors over the earplugs, then continue reading. You must remain within your bandstand. Instruct the next person to open their task.\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Josh&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Josh-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Team:</b> Do not read this out loud. Get a potato.\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Josh&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Josh-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Throw_the_rabbits_into_your_hat\" title=\"Throw the rabbits into your hat\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Throw the rabbits into your hat.\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>15</b>\n</td>\n<td>7\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>21\n</td>\n<td>25\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">30\n</td>\n<td>27\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Notes</b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"references-small\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Josh-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Josh_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Josh_1-1\">1.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Josh_Widdicombe\" title=\"Josh Widdicombe\">Josh Widdicombe</a> returned to help the two-player team, so didn't earn any points for himself.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_pistachio_eclair.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternative service <a href=\"/wiki/Watch_Taskmaster\" title=\"Watch Taskmaster\">here</a>.</i></small>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"> <a href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:Taskmaster_-_Series_2,_Episode_3_%27A_Pistachio_Eclair%27\" class=\"video video-thumbnail medium \"> \t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/f5/Taskmaster_-_Series_2%2C_Episode_3_%27A_Pistachio_Eclair%27/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20210130003849\" alt=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_2,_Episode_3_&#39;A_Pistachio_Eclair&#39;\" height=\"263\" width=\"350\" data-video-key=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_2,_Episode_3_&#39;A_Pistachio_Eclair&#39;\" data-video-name=\"Taskmaster - Series 2, Episode 3 &#39;A Pistachio Eclair&#39;\" class=\"\" /> \t<span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"> \t\t<svg class=\"thumbnail-play-icon wds-icon\" aria-label=\"Play\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-player-icon-play\"></use></svg>\t</span> </a> <figcaption></figcaption></figure><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_pistachio_eclair.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Due to the nature of the live task, in which the contestants were awarded a point for every rabbit, <a href=\"/wiki/Katherine_Ryan\" title=\"Katherine Ryan\">Katherine Ryan</a> set the record for the highest episode score with 30.\n<ul><li>Incidentally, <a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Osman\" title=\"Richard Osman\">Richard Osman</a>'s score of 27 is the highest second-place score in any episode of <i>Taskmaster</i>.</li>\n<li>This record was tied by <a href=\"/wiki/Dara_%C3%93_Briain\" title=\"Dara Ó Briain\">Dara Ó Briain</a> in the episode <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enormous_hugeness.\" title=\"Enormous hugeness.\">Enormous hugeness.</a></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_pistachio_eclair.?veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/pistachio-%C3%A9clair\"><i>A pistachio eclair.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/71671-003\"><i>A pistachio eclair.</i> on All 4</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmastersupermaxplus.vhx.tv/videos/episode-3-a-pistachio-eclair\"><i>A pistachio eclair.</i> on Supermax+</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141443\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.137 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 438/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24289/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 156/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 742/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 second